      "writtenOn": "2023-11-03T01:17:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks you for the answers.\nHaving a broadcastId only here looks the API not very matched.\nI was expecting there would be some callback with broadcast ID that I can get when the remote source(?) created.\nWhat are the APIs that I can get the lost remove source with the broadcast ID?",
